  "job_B22.3_20251003_114602": {
    "text": "Her ongin\u00f0 embe twelf derwyr\u00f0an stanas & gimmas \u00fee we leornudan in pocalipsis \u00fe\u00e6re bec.\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6reste gimcynn is \u00fe\u00e6t is blac & grene, & \u00fea hiw syndon buto tog\u00e6dere gemencgede, & sindon on\nO\u00fe\u00e6r is saphyrus, se is sunnan gelic, & on him standa\u00f0 swilce gildene steorran.\n\u00d0ridde is calcedonius haten, se ys byrnendum blacerne gelic.\nFeor\u00fea smaragdus, se ys swi\u00f0e grene.\nFyfta sardonix is haten, se is blode licost.\nSyxta onichinus is haten, se is ge brun & h\u00e6wen.\nSeofo\u00f0a sardius haten, se is luttran blode gelic.\nEhto\u00fea is berillus haten, se is luttran w\u00e6tere gelic.\nNigo\u00fea is crisoprassus haten, se is grenum lece gelic, & swilce him grene steorran of scinan.\nAndlyfta is topazius haten, se is golde gelic.\nTwelfta is carbunculus haten, se is byrnende glede gelic.\nSum stan is \u00fee adamans hatte, nele hine isern ne style ne awiht heardes gretan, ac \u00e6lc bi\u00f0 \u00fee forcu\u00f0ra\nSum stan hatte magneten, gif \u00fe\u00e6t isern bi\u00f0 bufan \u00fe\u00e6m stane, hit wyle feallan on \u00feane stan, gyf se stan\nAbestus hatte sum stancynn on claudea rice.\nGif he wyr\u00f0 onbyrnede, ne m\u00e6g hine w\u00e6ter ne wind adw\u00e6scan.\nSum stan is on persa rice, gif \u00feu hine mid handa ahrinest, he birne\u00f0 sona.\nSe stan is haten piriten.\nSeleten hatte sum stan \u00fe\u00e6s gecyndu sind \u00fe\u00e6t he mid wexsendan monan wexse\u00f0 & mid waniendan\nSe stan bi\u00f0 gemet on persa rice.\nSum stan hatte alexandrius.\nSe bi\u00f0 hwit & cristallum gelic.\nSum stan is \u00fee stircites hatte, in lucania man finde\u00f0, se is in sealfe se betsta.\nSum stan is cathotices haten, \u00feone man finde\u00f0 on corsia lande, se wile cleofian on wihta gewilcere \u00fee\nSum stan is \u00fee mocritum hatte, ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6fre niht to \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feystre \u00fe\u00e6t twegen heras ne magun gefeohtan\nAn stan is in Sicilia, acates haten, se w\u00e6s on Pires hyrnesse persea cyninges, \u00fe\u00e6s ansine is swilce an\nSe m\u00e6g wi\u00f0 \u00e6ghwylcum attre & duste.",
